+Furthermore, the URI cannot be changed once it's set. The module provides a
+FieldItemList class that handles the generation and update of the URI. An
+update to the URI is **only** allowed if the changes are strictly related to
+changing the case of the letters from lower to upper or vice versa, e.g.,
+changing `http://example.com/node/1` to `http://example.com/Node/1`.
